{"id":"bonhomme","lemma":"bonhomme","pos":"noun","rank":2594,"glosses":["fellow, chap","a basic figure meant to represent a person (e.g. a stick figure, a symbol on a sign, etc.)"],"ipa":"/bɔ.nɔm/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1e/Fr-bonhomme.ogg/Fr-bonhomme.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"bonshommes"},"formAudio":{"bonshommes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/53/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-bonshommes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je fais un bonhomme de neige.","en":"I'm making a snowman.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"snow"}]},{"text":"Qui a fait le bonhomme de neige ?","en":"Who built the snowman?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"snow"}]},{"text":"Le bonhomme a dormi toute la journée.","en":"The man lay asleep all day long.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to sleep","l":"dormir"},{"g":"all","l":"tout"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"day"}]},{"text":"Elle n'a pas épousé le bonhomme.","en":"She did not marry the man.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/271411","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to marry, to wed","l":"épouser"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"On devrait faire un bonhomme de neige.","en":"We should build a snowman.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"snow"}]}]}